#: src/introduction.md:3
msgid ""
"**goat is the operator's command-line for the data fabric** — one tool to "
"find the fabric, prove you can reach it, publish and subscribe to data, and "
"see what's happening underneath. It runs on macOS, Linux, and Windows, and "
"it works the same on a connected laptop or an air-gapped island."
msgstr ""
"**goat je operaterova naredbena linija za podatkovni fabric** — jedan alat "
"za pronalaženje fabrica, dokazivanje da ga možete dosegnuti, objavljivanje i "
"pretplatu na podatke te uvid u ono što se događa ispod. Radi na macOS-u, "
"Linuxu i Windowsu, a jednako funkcionira na povezanom prijenosnom računalu "
"ili na izoliranom otoku."

#: src/introduction.md:5
msgid "If you have five minutes, here's the whole thing:"
msgstr "Ako imate pet minuta, evo cijele priče:"

#: src/introduction.md:7
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"# 1. install it (one line — see \"Install & verify\" for the details)\n"
"curl -fsSL https://get.<your-goatnet>/goat-$(uname -s | tr A-Z a-z)-amd64 -o "
"~/.local/bin/goat && chmod +x ~/.local/bin/goat\n"
"\n"
"# 2. say hello — no profile, no mesh, no setup required\n"
"goat hello\n"
"\n"
"# 3. learn it hands-on, at your own pace\n"
"goat tutor\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"# 1. instalirajte ga (jedan redak — pogledajte \"Instalacija i provjera\" za "
"detalje)\n"
"curl -fsSL https://get.<your-goatnet>/goat-$(uname -s | tr A-Z a-z)-amd64 -o "
"~/.local/bin/goat && chmod +x ~/.local/bin/goat\n"
"\n"
"# 2. pozdravite — bez profila, bez mesha, bez potrebe za postavljanjem\n"
"goat hello\n"
"\n"
"# 3. naučite ga praktično, vlastitim tempom\n"
"goat tutor\n"
"```"

#: src/introduction.md:18
msgid ""
"That `goat hello` runs against an **in-process sandbox** — a fully simulated "
"fabric — so you can try the tool, learn the commands, and run the whole "
"tutorial before you've been handed any credentials, on a plane if you like. "
"When you're ready for the real thing, one bundle and `goat init` switches "
"you over."
msgstr ""
"Taj `goat hello` izvodi se nad **in-process sandboxom** — potpuno "
"simuliranim fabricom — pa možete isprobati alat, naučiti naredbe i proći "
"cijeli vodič prije nego što ste dobili ikakve vjerodajnice, čak i u avionu "
"ako želite. Kad budete spremni za pravu stvar, jedan bundle i `goat init` "
"prebacuju vas dalje."

#: src/introduction.md:20
msgid ""
"**The sandbox is always marked.** Anything simulated prints a `◇ SANDBOX` "
"banner. You will never mistake a practice run for the real fabric."
msgstr ""
"**Sandbox je uvijek označen.** Sve što je simulirano ispisuje `◇ SANDBOX` "
"natpis. Nikada nećete zamijeniti vježbu sa stvarnim fabricom."

#: src/introduction.md:22
