msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: src/install.md:45
msgid "`amd64`, `arm64`"
msgstr "`amd64`, `arm64`"

#: src/install.md:46
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: src/install.md:46
msgid "`amd64` (Intel), `arm64` (Apple Silicon)"
msgstr "`amd64` (Intel), `arm64` (Apple Silicon)"

#: src/install.md:47
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: src/install.md:47
msgid "`amd64`"
msgstr "`amd64`"

#: src/install.md:49
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "Ažuriranje"

#: src/install.md:51
msgid ""
"Re-run the install one-liner — it always fetches the version this site is "
"serving. To confirm what you have, `goat --version`."
msgstr ""
"Ponovno pokrenite instalacijsku jednolinijsku naredbu — uvijek dohvaća "
"verziju koju ovaj sajt poslužuje. Da biste potvrdili što imate, `goat --"
"version`."

#: src/languages.md:3
msgid ""
"goat speaks your language. Its human-facing text — errors, the `doctor` and "
"`status` readouts, the `--help` screens — is translated into **all 28 NATO-"
"member languages plus Ukrainian**."
msgstr ""
"goat govori vaš jezik. Njegov tekst namijenjen ljudima — pogreške, ispisi "
"naredbi `doctor` i `status`, `--help` ekrani — preveden je na **svih 28 "
"jezika članica NATO-a plus ukrajinski**."

#: src/languages.md:5
msgid "Choosing a language"
msgstr "Odabir jezika"

#: src/languages.md:7
msgid "goat picks a language in this order:"
msgstr "goat bira jezik ovim redoslijedom:"

#: src/languages.md:9
msgid "the `--lang` flag (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"
msgstr "zastavica `--lang` (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"

#: src/languages.md:10
msgid "the `GOAT_LANG` environment variable (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"
msgstr "varijabla okruženja `GOAT_LANG` (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"

#: src/languages.md:11
msgid "your operating system's locale,"
msgstr "lokalizacija (locale) vašeg operativnog sustava,"

#: src/languages.md:12
msgid "English."
msgstr "engleski."

#: src/languages.md:15
msgid "# just this command, in German\n"
msgstr "# samo ova naredba, na njemačkom\n"

#: src/languages.md:16
msgid "# everything, in French, for this shell\n"
msgstr "# sve, na francuskom, za ovaj shell\n"

#: src/languages.md:19
msgid ""
"English is the authoritative source: if a phrase hasn't been translated yet, "
"goat shows the English rather than a blank."
msgstr ""
"Engleski je mjerodavni izvor: ako fraza još nije prevedena, goat prikazuje "
"engleski umjesto praznine."

#: src/languages.md:21
msgid "What stays the same in every language"
msgstr "Što ostaje isto u svakom jeziku"

#: src/languages.md:23
msgid ""
"The **machine surface never changes**. `--json` field values, error codes "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), exit codes, command and flag names, and contract tokens "
"(paths, keys, URLs) are byte-for-byte identical no matter the language. "
"Translate the prose, not the contract — so your scripts work the same for "
"every operator."
msgstr ""
"**Strojna površina nikada se ne mijenja**. Vrijednosti polja `--json`, "
"kodovi pogrešaka (`E_OFF_MESH`, …), izlazni kodovi, nazivi naredbi i "
"zastavica te ugovorni tokeni (putanje, ključevi, URL-ovi) bajt-za-bajt su "
"identični bez obzira na jezik. Prevodi se proza, ne ugovor — pa vaše skripte "
"rade jednako za svakog operatera."

#: src/languages.md:25
msgid "A note on machine-translated text"
msgstr "Napomena o strojno prevedenom tekstu"

#: src/languages.md:27
msgid ""
"Most translations are machine-produced and awaiting native-speaker review. "
"When you run goat in one of those languages, it prints a short, one-time "
"notice on standard error telling you the text is machine-translated, that "
"the English is authoritative, and where to report a translation error. "
"Suppress it with `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."
msgstr ""
"Većina prijevoda je strojno generirana i čeka pregled izvornog govornika. "
"Kad pokrenete goat na jednom od tih jezika, ispisuje kratku, jednokratnu "
"obavijest na standardni izlaz pogrešaka koja vam govori da je tekst strojno "
"preveden, da je engleski mjerodavan i gdje prijaviti pogrešku u prijevodu. "
"Potisnite ju s `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."

#: src/languages.md:29
msgid ""
"If you speak one of these languages and spot something off, that report is "
"genuinely welcome — it's how the catalogs get better."
msgstr ""
"Ako govorite jedan od ovih jezika i uočite nešto neispravno, taj prijavak je "
"iskreno dobrodošao — tako se katalozi poboljšavaju."

#: src/languages.md:31
msgid "And one for fun"
msgstr "I jedan za zabavu"

#: src/languages.md:33
msgid ""
"`goat --lang tlh` renders the marquee lines in **Klingon**. It's an opt-in "
"easter egg — never selected automatically — and, like every other locale, it "
"can't touch the machine surface. Qapla'."
msgstr ""
"`goat --lang tlh` prikazuje istaknute retke na **klingonskom**. To je "
"opcionalni easter egg — nikada se ne odabire automatski — i, kao i svaka "
"druga lokalizacija, ne može dirati strojnu površinu. Qapla'."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "When something's wrong, start with one command:"
msgstr "Kad nešto nije u redu, počnite jednom naredbom:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:9
msgid ""
"It runs four steps in order and, for any that fails, prints a specific fix. "
"Here's how to read it."
msgstr ""
"Izvodi četiri koraka redom i, za svaki koji ne uspije, ispisuje konkretan "
"popravak. Evo kako ga čitati."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:11
msgid "Reading `goat doctor`"
msgstr "Čitanje `goat doctor`"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "Step"
msgstr "Korak"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "What it checks"
msgstr "Što provjerava"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Ako ne uspije"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "**mesh**"
msgstr "**mesh**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're on the fabric's network"
msgstr "Na mreži ste fabrica"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're off-mesh — bring up your tunnel (`netbird status` / re-enroll)"
msgstr ""
"Niste na meshu — podignite svoj tunel (`netbird status` / ponovno upišite)"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "**router**"
msgstr "**router**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "The fabric's router is reachable"
msgstr "Router fabrica je dosežan"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"The router may be down, or your endpoint is wrong — re-check your profile"
msgstr ""
"Router je možda nedostupan ili je vaša krajnja točka pogrešna — ponovno "
"provjerite svoj profil"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "**certificate**"
msgstr "**certifikat**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "Your identity is accepted"
msgstr "Vaš identitet je prihvaćen"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid ""
"Your cert may be expired or rejected — `goat profile show`, then re-onboard "
"if needed"
msgstr ""
"Vaš certifikat je možda istekao ili odbijen — `goat profile show`, zatim "
"ponovno provedite onboarding po potrebi"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "**portal**"
msgstr "**portal**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Your access token works"
msgstr "Vaš pristupni token radi"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Token expired or revoked — ask to be re-onboarded"
msgstr "Token je istekao ili opozvan — zatražite ponovni onboarding"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:20
msgid ""
"Each failed step exits with a distinct code, so a wrapper script can branch "
"without parsing text."
msgstr ""
"Svaki neuspjeli korak izlazi s različitim kodom, pa se omotač-skripta može "
"granati bez raščlanjivanja teksta."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:22
msgid "Common situations"
msgstr "Uobičajene situacije"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:24
msgid ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** You're not on the fabric's "
"network. Bring up your mesh tunnel and try again; `goat doctor` will confirm "
"once you're on."
msgstr ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** Niste na mreži fabrica. "
"Podignite svoj mesh tunel i pokušajte ponovno; `goat doctor` će potvrditi "
"kad budete na njoj."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Your identity is stale. "
"`goat profile show` to see its expiry; if it's past, you'll need a fresh "
"bundle."
msgstr ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Vaš identitet je "
"zastario. `goat profile show` za uvid u njegov istek; ako je prošao, trebat "
"će vam svjež bundle."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:30
msgid ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Your access token is no longer "
"valid (expired or revoked). Ask your administrator to re-onboard you."
msgstr ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Vaš pristupni token više nije "
"valjan (istekao ili opozvan). Zamolite svog administratora da vas ponovno "
"onboarda."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:33
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows a `[✗]`** `status` is the one-glance view; run `goat "
"doctor` for the stepped detail and the specific remedy."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` prikazuje `[✗]`** `status` je prikaz na jedan pogled; "
"pokrenite `goat doctor` za detalje po koracima i konkretan lijek."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:36
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows `ztol` green but `session` red** The router port accepts connections, but a Zenoh session does not open: the router is wedged, or it rejects your certificate. A mesh bounce does not fix this. Run `goat doctor` and tell your administrator."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` prikazuje `ztol` zeleno, ali `session` crveno** Port usmjerivača prihvaća veze, ali se Zenoh sesija ne otvara: usmjerivač je zaglavio ili odbija vaš certifikat. Ponovno pokretanje mesh veze to ne rješava. Pokrenite `goat doctor` i obavijestite svog administratora."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "Understanding an error code"
msgstr "Razumijevanje koda pogreške"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:38
msgid "Every error carries a stable code (like `E_OFF_MESH`). To look one up:"
msgstr ""
"Svaka pogreška nosi stabilan kod (poput `E_OFF_MESH`). Da biste ga potražili:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:44
msgid "Practice without risk"
msgstr "Vježbajte bez rizika"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:46
msgid ""
"If you just want to explore commands without touching anything real, the "
"sandbox is always there:"
msgstr ""
"Ako samo želite istraživati naredbe bez dirања ičega stvarnog, sandbox je "
"uvijek tu:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:53
msgid "Still stuck?"
msgstr "Još ste zaglavili?"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:55
msgid ""
"Capture the exact command and its output (use `--json` for a clean, complete "
"record) and bring it to your goat administrator."
msgstr ""
"Zabilježite točnu naredbu i njezin izlaz (koristite `--json` za čist, potpun "
"zapis) i donesite ih svom goat administratoru."

#: src/admin.md:3
msgid ""
"`goat admin` is the operator surface: onboarding and revoking participants, "
"rotating certificates, cutting a misbehaving peer off the mesh, provisioning "
"devices, and LAN-side triage. It sits apart from the everyday commands on "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"`goat admin` je operatorsko sučelje: uvođenje i opoziv sudionika, rotacija "
"certifikata, isključivanje problematičnog peera s mrežice, dodjeljivanje "
"uređaja i dijagnostika na LAN strani. Namjerno je odvojen od svakodnevnih "
"naredbi."

#: src/admin.md:5
msgid ""
"**Operator-only.** These commands are for operators who hold admin "
"credentials. If you're a participant publishing and subscribing on the "
"fabric, this chapter isn't your day-to-day — your surface is **[Everyday "
"tasks](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / `health`). `goat "
"admin` is **inert for non-admins**: an unauthorized call changes nothing and "
"tells you so."
msgstr ""
"**Samo za operatore.** Ove naredbe namijenjene su operatorima koji posjeduju "
"admin vjerodajnice. Ako ste sudionik koji objavljuje i pretplaćuje se na "
"fabrici, ovo poglavlje nije vaš svakodnevni alat — vaše sučelje je "
"**[Svakodnevni zadaci](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / "
"`health`). `goat admin` je **neaktivan za ne-admine**: neovlašteni poziv "
"ništa ne mijenja i obavještava vas o tome."

#: src/admin.md:7
msgid "What \"operator-only\" means in practice"
msgstr "Što \"samo za operatore\" znači u praksi"

#: src/admin.md:9
msgid ""
"The authority isn't in the CLI — it's in _your credentials_. `goat` itself "
"is a thin client; whether you may onboard an org or eject a peer is decided "
"by what your operator profile and environment carry, and confirmed by the "
"portal and the NetBird management API. So an admin command can stop in two "
"honest places:"
msgstr ""
"Ovlast nije u CLI-u — ona je u _vašim vjerodajnicama_. `goat` je tanki "
"klijent; to može li se uvesti organizacija ili izbaciti peer određeno je "
"onim što nosi vaš operatorski profil i okruženje, a potvrđuje portal i "
"NetBird management API. Stoga admin naredba može stati na dva legitimna "
"mjesta:"

#: src/admin.md:11
msgid ""
"**Up front, before anything is sent.** If your machine has no operator setup "
"at all — no initialized profile and no operator environment — `goat admin` "
"refuses immediately with `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Nothing leaves your laptop."
msgstr ""
"**Unaprijed, prije nego što se išta pošalje.** Ako vaše računalo nema "
"nikakav operatorski postav — bez inicijaliziranog profila i bez operatorskog "
"okruženja — `goat admin` odmah odbija s `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Ništa ne napušta vaše "
"prijenosno računalo."

#: src/admin.md:12
msgid ""
"**Server-side, at the action.** If you do have credentials but they aren't "
"authorized for this action, the portal or NetBird returns a refusal. A "
"refused _mutation_ means nothing changed — and `goat` reports it as "
"`E_NOT_ADMIN`, not as a vague token error."
msgstr ""
"**Na strani poslužitelja, pri izvršavanju akcije.** Ako imate vjerodajnice, "
"ali nisu ovlaštene za ovu akciju, portal ili NetBird vraća odbijanje. "
"Odbijena _mutacija_ znači da se ništa nije promijenilo — a `goat` to "
"prijavljuje kao `E_NOT_ADMIN`, ne kao nejasnu grešku tokena."

#: src/admin.md:14
msgid "Two error codes you'll want to tell apart:"
msgstr "Dva koda greške koje ćete htjeti razlikovati:"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Kod"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Značenje"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Što učiniti"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Your credential is **valid but not authorized** for this action (or no "
"operator credential is configured)."
msgstr ""
"Vaša vjerodajnica je **važeća, ali nije ovlaštena** za ovu akciju (ili nije "
"konfigurirana operatorska vjerodajnica)."

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Confirm you're on your operator profile and have sourced your operator "
"environment. If you still can't, this action isn't for your role — contact "
"your goat administrator. Re-onboarding won't change it."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite koristite li operatorski profil i jeste li učitali operatorsko "
"okruženje. Ako i dalje ne možete, ova akcija nije za vašu ulogu — obratite "
"se svom goat administratoru. Ponovni onboarding to neće promijeniti."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"
msgstr "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Your credential is **expired or bad** (HTTP 401)."
msgstr "Vaša vjerodajnica je **istekla ili neispravna** (HTTP 401)."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Re-onboard to get a fresh token."
msgstr "Napravite ponovni onboarding kako biste dobili svježi token."

#: src/admin.md:21
msgid ""
"Reading about admin is never gated: `goat admin --help` and `goat admin "
"<cmd> --help` always work, in every language. Only _running_ an action is "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Čitanje o adminu nikad nije zaštićeno: `goat admin --help` i `goat admin "
"<cmd> --help` uvijek rade, u svakom jeziku. Provjera se vrši samo pri "
"_izvršavanju_ akcije."

#: src/admin.md:23
msgid "The commands"
msgstr "Naredbe"

#: src/admin.md:25
msgid ""
"Add `--help` to any of these for the full flag set, or see the **[Command "
"reference](reference.md)** — the details there are generated from the "
"binary, so they always match what you're running."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte `--help` uz bilo koju od ovih naredbi za puni skup zastavica ili "
"pogledajte **[Referentne naredbe](reference.md)** — tamo su detalji "
"generirani iz binarne datoteke, pa uvijek odgovaraju onome što pokrenete."

#: src/admin.md:41
msgid "A few notes:"
msgstr "Nekoliko napomena:"

#: src/admin.md:43
msgid ""
"**`lan` is the break-glass diagnostic.** `scan` and `doctor` mutate nothing, "
"need no credentials, and are built to work when the mesh and every service "
"are down — so they're the one part of `goat admin` that isn't refused for a "
"missing operator environment."
msgstr ""
"**`lan` je dijagnostika za nužne slučajeve.** `scan` i `doctor` ništa ne "
"mutiraju, ne trebaju vjerodajnice i napravljeni su da rade kad su mrežica i "
"sve usluge nedostupne — stoga su jedini dio `goat admin` koji nije odbijen "
"zbog nedostajućeg operatorskog okruženja."

#: src/admin.md:44
msgid ""
"**`rotate` keeps identity fixed.** It re-issues the leaf certificate for the "
"same anchor, alias, write namespace, and ACL — only the cert and key are "
"new. Use it for renewal or re-keying, not for changing who someone is."
msgstr ""
"**`rotate` čuva identitet nepromijenjenim.** Ponovo izdaje list certifikat "
"za isti anchor, alias, prostornicu pisanja i ACL — samo su certifikat i "
"ključ novi. Koristite ga za obnavljanje ili zamjenu ključa, ne za mijenjanje "
"nečijeg identiteta."

#: src/admin.md:45
msgid ""
"**`peer cut` is the real cut.** On the brokerless fabric a certificate is "
"inert without a mesh path, so removing the _peer_ is what stops a flooder — "
"`goat health` finds it, `goat admin peer cut` ejects it."
msgstr ""
"**`peer cut` je pravi rez.** Na fabrici bez brokera certifikat je neaktivan "
"bez mrežnog puta, pa je uklanjanje _peera_ ono što zaustavlja poplavljača — "
"`goat health` ga pronalazi, `goat admin peer cut` ga izbacuje."

#: src/admin.md:46
msgid ""
"**Destructive actions confirm first.** `org delete`, `peer cut`, and the `--"
"org` cascades print what they're about to do and ask before acting (`--yes` "
"to skip, `--dry-run` to preview)."
msgstr ""
"**Destruktivne akcije prvo traže potvrdu.** `org delete`, `peer cut` i "
"kaskade s `--org` ispisuju što će učiniti i pitaju prije izvršavanja (`--"
"yes` za preskakanje, `--dry-run` za pregled)."

#: src/admin.md:48
msgid "If you see `E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "Ako vidite `E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:50
msgid "Nothing was changed. Walk through it:"
msgstr "Ništa nije promijenjeno. Prođite kroz sljedeće korake:"

#: src/admin.md:52
msgid ""
"**Are you on your operator profile?** `goat context use <name>` selects it; "
"`goat profile show` confirms which one is active."
msgstr ""
"**Koristite li operatorski profil?** `goat context use <name>` ga odabire; "
"`goat profile show` potvrđuje koji je aktivan."

#: src/admin.md:53
msgid ""
"**Have you sourced your operator environment?** Admin actions read operator "
"credentials from the environment (for example `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` and the "
"NetBird admin token) — never from the profile on disk."
msgstr ""
"**Jeste li učitali operatorsko okruženje?** Admin akcije čitaju operatorske "
"vjerodajnice iz okruženja (primjerice `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` i NetBird admin "
"token) — nikad iz profila na disku."

#: src/admin.md:54
msgid ""
"**Should you have this access at all?** If you've checked the above and the "
"portal still refuses, your role isn't authorized for this action. Contact "
"your goat administrator — re-onboarding the same identity won't grant it."
msgstr ""
"**Biste li uopće trebali imati ovaj pristup?** Ako ste provjerili navedeno, "
"a portal i dalje odbija, vaša uloga nije ovlaštena za ovu akciju. Obratite "
"se svom goat administratoru — ponovni onboarding istog identiteta to neće "
"dodijeliti."

#: src/admin.md:56
msgid "The full operator workflow"
msgstr "Cjelokupni operatorski tijek rada"

#: src/admin.md:58
msgid ""
"This chapter orients you to the surface and how it behaves. The end-to-end "
"operator workflow — the capability model, setting up your environment and "
"certificates, and the onboard / revoke / rotate / audit loop — lives in the "
"**admin-operator guide** that ships with your goatnet's operations docs, not "
"in this book."
msgstr ""
"Ovo poglavlje vas usmjerava prema sučelju i njegovom ponašanju. Cjeloviti "
"operatorski tijek rada — model ovlasti, postavljanje okruženja i certifikata "
"te petlja onboard / revoke / rotate / audit — nalazi se u **vodiču za admin-"
"operatora** koji se isporučuje s dokumentacijom vašeg goatnet operativnog "
"postava, a ne u ovoj knjizi."

