#: src/getting-started.md:50
msgid ""
"The first line is not optional. `goat` ships trusting **no** goatnet, so "
"`profile init` refuses until you add the root that signed your bundle — the "
"`-ca.pem` ships beside the `.cbor` it verifies. `goat ca add` prints a "
"fingerprint; check it against one your operator gives you before relying on "
"it, because a bundle that reached you over a channel proves only that the "
"channel delivered it. `goat ca ls` shows what you trust; one binary works "
"against every goatnet whose root you have added."
msgstr ""
"Prvi redak nije opcionalan. `goat` se isporučuje ne vjerujući **nijednom** goatnetu, pa `profile init` odbija dok ne dodate korijen koji je potpisao vaš paket — `-ca.pem` se isporučuje uz `.cbor` koji provjerava. `goat ca add` ispisuje otisak; provjerite ga s onim koji vam da operater prije nego se na njega oslonite, jer paket koji vam je stigao kanalom dokazuje samo da ga je kanal isporučio. `goat ca ls` pokazuje čemu vjerujete; jedna binarna datoteka radi protiv svakog goatneta čiji ste korijen dodali."

#: src/concepts.md:9
msgid ""
"You join with an **identity**: an onboarding _bundle_ that carries your "
"certificate, an access token, and where the fabric lives. The fabric admits "
"you by _who you are_, not by a shared password. `goat ca add <bundle-"
"ca.pem>` tells goat which CA to trust — it ships trusting none — and `goat "
"profile init <bundle.cbor>` then installs that identity; you can hold "
"several under different _contexts_ and switch between them."
msgstr ""
"Pridružujete se s **identitetom**: onboarding _paketom_ koji nosi vaš certifikat, pristupni token i gdje se tkanina nalazi. Tkanina vas prima prema tome _tko ste_, a ne prema dijeljenoj lozinki. `goat ca add <bundle-ca.pem>` govori goatu kojem CA vjerovati — isporučuje se ne vjerujući nijednom — a `goat profile init <bundle.cbor>` zatim instalira taj identitet; možete držati više njih pod različitim _kontekstima_ i prebacivati se između njih."
